     "n": 26,
     "text": "let us, who do understand this,"
    },
    {
     "n": 27,
     "text": "restrain ourselves in this regard;"
    },
    {
     "n": 28,
     "text": "for that is how conflicts are laid to rest."
    },
    {
     "n": 29,
     "text": "Those who contemplate the beautiful,"
    },
    {
     "n": 30,
     "text": "their faculties unrestrained,"
    },
    {
