     "text": "one who does good delights in both places."
    },
    {
     "n": 79,
     "text": "They delight thinking of good things they’ve done;"
    },
    {
     "n": 80,
     "text": "when gone to a good place, they delight all the more."
    },
    {
     "n": 81,
     "text": "Much though they may recite scripture,"
